{"id":"steam-709010","steam":709010,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Offroad Transport Simulator","summary":"Sit behind the wheel of powerful trucks and take care of business. Face a harsh off-road environment and maintain your vehicles and equipment to successfully transport valuable cargo long distances! Be careful to not get stuck in the mud as the time is money and your competition never sleeps!","about":"Offroad Transport Simulator is the ultimate, sandbox experience jampacked with off-road challenges, advanced raw terrain modification system, day-night cycle, and plenty of great features that will satisfy even the most hardcore drivers. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs a freelance driver in the transportation industry, you’ll have a base truck and a rescue jeep at your disposal. Complete your objectives delivering various cargo to the buyers. Earn money, gain reputation and leave your competitors in the mud.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUse your earnings to repair and modify your vehicle. Buy brand new machines that enable the transportation of different kinds of cargo such as wood, rocks, barrels, and more. Express yourself by customizing your truck, change the paint job, and personalize it with the stickers/decals to build your in-game brand!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n• Open world with random events.\r\n• Day/night system.\r\n• Dynamic mud/dirt terrain manipulation system. \r\n• 11 Warehouses.\r\n• 8 Vehicles each with a full physic base drive model.\r\n• Winch systems.\r\n• Weight systems.\r\n• Vehicle gearbox systems in manual and automatic.\r\n• Dynamic drivetrain systems.\r\n• Diff lock systems.\r\n• Vehicle Customization.\r\n• 3 types of jobs \"Transport Jobs\",  \"Rescue Missions\" and \"Cargo Jobs\".\r\n• Independent cargo trading. \r\n• Support for steering wheel controllers. \r\n• Vehicle durability, repair systems, and repair stations.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/portrait.png?t=1612794904","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/header.jpg?t=1612794904","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/header.jpg?t=1612794904","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_31d9532bd98f75e9cbd3df158d91b767886f9b88.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_31d9532bd98f75e9cbd3df158d91b767886f9b88.jpg?t=1612794904"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_24eb63e9ffb01593a9bac96eca2b10fd09709d75.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_24eb63e9ffb01593a9bac96eca2b10fd09709d75.jpg?t=1612794904"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_854629bfea3a20590b1c9ffe81109e1fea55b1b9.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_854629bfea3a20590b1c9ffe81109e1fea55b1b9.jpg?t=1612794904"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_78ab07906b4ea060eba2f9ac502d92af57b0423b.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_78ab07906b4ea060eba2f9ac502d92af57b0423b.jpg?t=1612794904"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_b0979a027db0412cf404711095375dfe74ef370f.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_b0979a027db0412cf404711095375dfe74ef370f.jpg?t=1612794904"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_99e374f55cd3afff0908ae59aa095767bc612171.600x338.jpg?t=1612794904","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709010/ss_99e374f55cd3afff0908ae59aa09